Job Description Business Intelligence Consultant Position: Business Intelligence Consultant Experience: 10-15 yrs Location: Noida Shift: General Shift No. of Position: 1 Travel: Yes, To Egypt. (Frequent travel required) Job Overview: Hy Tech Pro is looking for a Senior BI Consultant who will take complete ownership of the Business Intelligence (BI) function for enterprise-scale transformation initiatives. This individual will act as the BI Owner during the Discovery Phase, responsible for defining strategy, governance, architecture, and roadmap. Following Discovery, this role will expand into a leadership position with responsibility for building and leading a BI team to implement and operationalize the roadmap. Key

RESPONSIBILITIES:
Act as the BI Owner for the Discovery Phase. Lead the assessment of enterprise systems (Admissions, LMS, HR, Exam, Finance, etc.). Conduct stakeholder workshops to capture business and technical requirements. Requirements Catalogue Gap Analysis Report BI Governance Framework High-Level BI Architecture Blueprint (Bronze/Silver/Gold data layers, 360° data view) Phased BI Implementation Roadmap Ensure data governance, quality, and compliance standards are embedded. Collaborate with and guide a Business Analyst during Discovery. Present findings and recommendations to senior leadership. Post-Discovery: build, mentor, and lead a BI team (data engineers, analysts, visualization experts) to deliver the BI roadmap. Establish ongoing BI governance, best practices, and standards. Requirements Qualification, Skills & Experience: 8–12 years of experience in BI, Data Warehousing, or Analytics. Proven experience in owning BI strategy and leading BI teams. Strong expertise in the Microsoft Azure Data Platform (Data Lake, Synapse/Databricks, Data Factory, Purview). Proficiency in Power BI (data modeling, DAX, dashboards, governance). Experience designing and implementing enterprise BI architectures and roadmaps. Strong understanding of data governance, compliance, and security frameworks (GDPR/FERPA preferred). Excellent consulting, stakeholder management, and leadership skills. Domain knowledge in education or similar enterprise environments (preferred). Bachelor’s degree in computer science, Data Science, Information Systems, or related field (Master’s preferred). Relevant certifications (preferred): Microsoft Certified: Data Analyst Associate Microsoft Certified: Azure Data Engineer / Solutions Architect Certified Business Intelligence Professional (CBIP) I'm interested View all jobs Visit website Powered by {{criteria Index}} {{field}} {{captialize(condition)}} ( ) {{cx Prop Help Text}} {{cx Prop Field.consent_details.description}} {{record.Posting_Title}} {{record.Posting_Titl